/-!
# Step-0 fresh and smudge column totals

Column packing is quantified over coefficients and columns.
Digit accumulation retains every indexed weight and its error budget.
The block-diagonal digit-body relation is a separate explicit obligation.

Generated by `crates/io/lean/dio2/generator/gen_online0_chains.py`.
Large finite families remain quantified; only the two encoding ports and six
encoding components are split. This is a conditional stage interface, not the
closed correctness certificate.
-/

set_option maxHeartbeats 16000000
set_option maxRecDepth 16384

